        "Description": [
            {
                "value": "This woody plant data was collected by ecological survey in western Rwanda in four districts: Rubavu, Rutsiro, Ngororero, and Nyabihu. The data collection covers different land-uses in the landscape: homegardens, pasture, agricultural mosaics, and tree patches. The data is a count data of woody plant species conducted using the established standard of ecological survey, such as height and DBH (diameter at breast height).",
